WeAre! extensions

This repository contains binaries built from a modified copy of
keiyoushi/extensions-source (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source),
commit dbf6c05d6a9520c60533f1626616263522bbe71a, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications (see alteracoes/weare-sobre-keiyoushi-dbf6c05.diff):
- build: optional application id prefix (app.weare.extension) for a separate signing key;
- MangaDash: clear error messages for 18+ titles without login and for PDF chapters on Suwayomi.

